      "ambiguityReviewed": true,
      "unresolvedIdentity": true,
      "reason": "This resolves the current applicable hold for p006 (component 047d691b) from the source. The original hold faulted a failed name witness and the risk of inventing a binding for an unnamed placeholder. In the current s0005, 會伯父羅仇、麹粥 names Luoqiu and Quzhou as Mengxun's 伯父, his father's elder brothers, so Mengxun's unnamed father is entailed by the kinship term. The current native witness quotes that exact sentence. The record stays nameless: descriptive kinship 蒙遜父, an undated attestation, and younger-sibling-of p004/p005 on the paternal line, all supported by 伯父. No Chinese personal name or date is invented. The anchor is p006 itself, a singleton accepted membership (fingerprint unchanged), which is conservative and merges no one. He is the same real person as the p053 and p076 placeholders (per_43B936PQ57SAHTQ7DDGB and per_HGFBDSN06YQ55XDAX3CJ, whose bounded headers carry the same descriptive name). This report cannot author that merge, so it stays open and unresolvedIdentity stays true. The p053 historical changed-source hold (5dccc0d0) is preserved and is not resolved here.",
      "sourceWitnesses": [
        {
          "localId": "jinshu:129:p006",
          "book": "jinshu",
          "chapter": "129",
          "unitId": "s0005",
          "quote": "會伯父羅仇、麹粥從呂光征河南，光前軍大敗，麹粥言于兄羅仇曰：「主上荒耄驕縱，諸子朋黨相傾，讒人側目。"
        }
      ],
      "resolvesHolds": [
        "sha256:047d691b0f748e7507e7db304dd4e9b52e917d6e324f9c5f4d1e9caa18b8fdae"
      ]
    },
    {
      "caseId": "sha256:f922ea4d1e040404d9366e11c262048b7bacf738ace0f1c879b63eae21589fb2",
      "verdict": "approve",
      "canonicalPersonId": "per_HGFBDSN06YQ55XDAX3CJ",
      "membershipReviewed": true,
      "membershipFingerprint": "sha256:664b67442e9e5aac42540974d14ec6839ae4f6ab5d96651b39c56e955b0aed52",
      "ambiguityReviewed": true,
      "unresolvedIdentity": true,
      "reason": "This resolves the current applicable hold for p076 (component 047d691b) from the source. The original hold faulted failed name witnesses at s0129 and s0148 and the risk of inventing a binding. In the current s0129, 以從弟成都為金山太守，羅仇子也 makes Chengdu, Luoqiu's son, Mengxun's paternal cousin 從弟, so Luoqiu is a brother of Mengxun's father and the unnamed father is entailed. In s0148, 以其弟挐 names Nu as Mengxun's younger brother, which supports this same unnamed father being Nu's father (parent-of p084). The record stays nameless, with descriptive kinship and an undated attestation, and no name or date is invented. The anchor is p076 itself, a singleton accepted membership (fingerprint unchanged), which is conservative and merges no one. He is the same real person as the p006 and p053 placeholders (per_GD6G74C0V2JZZ6TGE3YQ and per_43B936PQ57SAHTQ7DDGB). That merge stays open and unresolvedIdentity stays true. The p053 historical hold (5dccc0d0) is preserved.",
      "sourceWitnesses": [
        {
          "localId": "jinshu:129:p076",
          "book": "jinshu",
          "chapter": "129",
          "unitId": "s0129",
          "quote": "以從弟成都為金山太守，羅仇子也；"
        }
      ],
      "resolvesHolds": [
        "sha256:047d691b0f748e7507e7db304dd4e9b52e917d6e324f9c5f4d1e9caa18b8fdae"
      ]
    }
  ]
